[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16501.83, "timestamp": "04:35:01", "text": "喜欢朋克的人，来了。朋克魔力。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16504.51, "timestamp": "04:35:04", "text": "哥特风，你知道，就是那种哥特女性。如果你喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16514.789, "timestamp": "04:35:14", "text": "你。这款皮肤太酷了。名称"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16517.349, "timestamp": "04:35:17", "text": "盘子很酷。挺酷的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16521.15, "timestamp": "04:35:21", "text": "是的。是的。这个表情是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16524.709, "timestamp": "04:35:24", "text": "凉爽的。还有，如果你不知道的话，小姐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16528.31, "timestamp": "04:35:28", "text": "这位魔法小姐有两种形态。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16530.67, "timestamp": "04:35:30", "text": "黑暗"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16533.59, "timestamp": "04:35:33", "text": "孩子。是的。哦，是的。颜色"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16535.75, "timestamp": "04:35:35", "text": "争吵。我把那件事忘了。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16547.39, "timestamp": "04:35:47", "text": "吸她的另一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16550.15, "timestamp": "04:35:50", "text": "源自炼狱。如果你不知道什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16557.67, "timestamp": "04:35:57", "text": "地狱。嗯，那是她所处的地狱维度。"}]